---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import { park } from '../data/park';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="How to Reach Lake View Park from Rawalpindi"
  description="How to reach Lake View Park from Rawalpindi: route via the Islamabad Expressway and Murree Road, editorial time estimates and practical notes."
  path="/from-rawalpindi/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'How long does it take from Rawalpindi to Lake View Park?', a: 'The journey is often 30–50 minutes via the Islamabad Expressway and Murree Road, longer at peak hours and weekends. These are editorial estimates, not a measured time — verify the live route in your map app.' },
    { q: 'What is the route from Rawalpindi?', a: 'Take the Islamabad Expressway toward Islamabad, continue to Murree Road and the Rawal Dam / Lake View Park signs, then use the Plus Code to reach the park.' },
    { q: 'Can I use public transport from Rawalpindi?', a: 'Possibly for part of the way — plan the final stretch with CDA’s transit map and possibly a short ride-hail, since this guide hasn’t verified a direct service to the gate.' },
    { q: 'How do I plan the return?', a: 'Arrange your return before the park quiets in the evening, when ride-hail supply can thin out.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'From Rawalpindi', href: '/from-rawalpindi/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'How to get there', href: '/how-to-get-there/' },
    { label: 'From central Islamabad', href: '/from-islamabad-city/' },
    { label: 'Public transport', href: '/public-transport/' },
    { label: 'Parking', href: '/parking/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">For travellers coming from Rawalpindi, the usual approach is through Islamabad and then along Murree Road to the lake. Times below are <strong>editorial estimates</strong>; confirm the live route in your map app.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Route overview</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">From Rawalpindi, take the <strong>Islamabad Expressway</strong> toward Islamabad, then continue to Murree Road and the Rawal Dam / Lake View Park signs. The journey is often 30–50 minutes, longer at peak hours and on weekends.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Navigating near the lake</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Once you are close, paste the Plus Code <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1">{park.plusCode}</code> into your map app to reach the park rather than guessing a street number. Confirm the open gate and drop-off with on-site management.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Tips</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li>Build in buffer for Expressway traffic, especially in the morning and evening peaks.</li>
        <li>If using public transport, plan the final stretch with CDA’s transit map and possibly a short ride-hail.</li>
        <li>Arrange your return before the park quiets in the evening.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">Estimate, not a promise</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">Roadworks, checkpoints and events can change this route. Verify the live path and current travel time in your map app on the day.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Build in buffer</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Roadworks, checkpoints and events can change this route on the day. Verify the live path and travel time in your map app, and don’t rely on a fixed schedule — the lake is the reliable destination once you arrive.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="From Rawalpindi checklist" items={[
      'Allow 30–50 minutes, more at peak hours.',
      'Use the Islamabad Expressway then Murree Road.',
      'Pin the Plus Code near the lake to reach the park.',
      'Arrange your return before the park quiets.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
